fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstmemory.html#gst_memory_is_writable","fragment":"\n\tgst_memory_is_writable\n\n\n\tGst.Memory.prototype.is_writable\n\n\n\tGst.Memory.is_writable\n\nTests if you can safely modify memory. It is only safe to modify memory when\nthere is only one owner of the memory - ie, the object is writable.\nParameters:\na GstMemory\nTests if you can safely modify memory. It is only safe to modify memory when\nthere is only one owner of the memory - ie, the object is writable.\nParameters:\na Gst.Memory\nTests if you can safely modify memory. It is only safe to modify memory when\nthere is only one owner of the memory - ie, the object is writable.\nParameters:\na Gst.Memory\n"});